 "description": "Read a lease's ledger: charges, payments, credits, refunds, deposits and other transactions with date, type, total amount and journal lines. Read-only \u2014 this server never posts to a ledger. Buildium: GET /v1/leases/{leaseId}/transactions.",
 "inputSchema": {
